            <ArticleTitle>Patient/provider education is cornerstone of successful DM approach to asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>144-6, 132, suppl 1 p.</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Never underestimate the power of education in managing asthma. Even when you think you're doing all you can to educate patients and providers, at least one new study suggests there is usually ample room for improvement. See how one organization intends to build on its early success in the effective management of asthma through education.</AbstractText>
